<div type="level1" xml:id="wibarab.paratexts.index">
  <head>What is Bedouin-Type Arabic?</head>
  <p>A project conducted within the ERC Advanced Grant investigating the
  linguistic and socio-historical realities behind the millennia-old
  dichotomous concept of nomadic and sedentary people in the Middle East
  and North Africa. This project has received funding from the European
  Research Council (ERC) under the European Union's Horizon 2020
  research and innovation programme (grant agreement No. [101020127-
  WIRARAB])</p>
